<template><section class="container page"><div class="page-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">YOUR BAG</span><h1>购物车</h1><p>把喜欢的新鲜带回家。</p></div><span class="muted">{{cartCount}} 件商品</span></div><div v-if="items.length" class="cart-layout"><div class="cart-list"><div class="cart-head"><span>商品信息</span><span>单价</span><span>数量</span><span>小计</span></div><div v-for="item in items" :key="item.productId" class="cart-item"><div class="cart-product"><span class="cart-thumb" :style="{background:item.product.color}">{{item.product.emoji}}</span><div><b>{{item.product.name}}</b><small>{{item.product.origin}} · {{item.product.unit}}</small></div></div><strong>¥{{item.product.price.toFixed(1)}}</strong><div class="stepper"><button @click="change(item,-1)">−</button><span>{{item.quantity}}</span><button @click="change(item,1)">+</button></div><strong class="subtotal">¥{{item.subtotal.toFixed(1)}}</strong><button class="remove" @click="remove(item)">×</button></div><div class="cart-note">♧ 鲜选承诺：商品不新鲜，支持收货后 24 小时内申请售后</div></div><aside class="summary"><h3>订单摘要</h3><div><span>商品小计</span><b>¥{{total.toFixed(1)}}</b></div><div><span>配送费</span><b>{{total>=59?'免配送':'¥6.0'}}</b></div><div class="coupon">🎟 有 2 张优惠券可用 <span>去使用 ›</span></div><hr/><div class="sum-total"><span>合计</span><strong>¥{{(total+(total>=59?0:6)).toFixed(1)}}</strong></div><button class="primary full" @click="$router.push('/checkout')">去结算 <span>→</span></button><router-link class="continue" to="/category">继续购物</router-link></aside></div><div v-else class="empty"><div>🛒</div><h2>购物车还是空的</h2><p>去挑选一些新鲜好物吧</p><button class="primary" @click="$router.push('/category')">去逛逛</button></div></section></template>
<script setup>import { computed } from 'vue'; import { cartItems,cartCount,store } from '../data'; const items=cartItems; const total=computed(()=>items.value.reduce((s,i)=>s+i.subtotal,0)); const change=(item,n)=>{item.quantity+=n;if(item.quantity<=0)remove(item)}; const remove=item=>{const i=store.cart.findIndex(x=>x.productId===item.productId);store.cart.splice(i,1)}</script>
